Delete a task by ID (requires confirmation unless --force/-f or --quiet/-q).

Examples:
  paso task delete 42
  paso task delete 42 -f
  paso task delete 42 --force --json

Usage:
  paso task delete <id> [flags]

Flags:
  -f, --force   Skip confirmation
  -j, --json    Output in JSON format
  -q, --quiet   Minimal output
